      "label": "GPIO4 (Led Neopixel)",
      "codeName": "D4",
      "capabilities": [
        "digital_output",
        "led_neopixel"
      ],
      "notes": "PIN_NEOPIXEL — onboard single status NeoPixel (WS2812), output-only data line. Confirmed via Adafruit's own learn.adafruit.com pinouts guide (\"the status NeoPixel LED... In Arduino it's digital pin 4\"), CircuitPython mpconfigboard.h (MICROPY_HW_NEOPIXEL -> pin_GPIO4), and Zephyr's adafruit_feather_scorpio_rp2040.dts onboard ws2812 node (gpio0 pin 4)."
    },
    {
      "name": "D5",
      "label": "D5 (GPIO5)",
      "codeName": "D5",
      "capabilities": [
        "digital_input",
        "digital_output",
